WEBVTT

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:18.160
<i>Oh Yeah!
Be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:18.160
<i>Oh Yeah!
tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:24.210
<i>Pass the orbit beyond the sky</i>

00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:24.210
<i>oozora kidou wo koero</i>

00:00:36.050 --> 00:00:40.970
<i>Can't hold back this rushing speed</i>

00:00:36.050 --> 00:00:40.970
<i>osaekirenai maenomeri na speed</i>

00:00:41.140 --> 00:00:45.980
<i>A familiar town turns into a diorama</i>

00:00:41.140 --> 00:00:45.980
<i>minareta machi ga diorama ni naru</i>

00:00:46.150 --> 00:00:51.190
<i>Burst through the unclear skies</i>

00:00:46.150 --> 00:00:51.190
<i>futoumei na sora tsukinukerunda</i>

00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:56.360
<i>Blow away your worries and discontent</i>

00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:56.360
<i>nayami toka fuman toka futtobashite</i>

00:00:56.530 --> 00:01:01.790
<i>Who needs a journey that's by the book</i>

00:00:56.530 --> 00:01:01.790
<i>manual doori no tabi nanka irane</i>

00:01:01.950 --> 00:01:07.580
<i>Even if you're lost or trembling,
Raise the altitude</i>

00:01:01.950 --> 00:01:07.580
<i>mayottemo furuetemo koudo agete</i>

00:01:07.750 --> 00:01:12.590
<i>Oh Yeah!
Show off, mess up, stand back up</i>

00:01:07.750 --> 00:01:12.590
<i>Oh Yeah!
ikigatte shikujitte tachiagatte</i>

00:01:12.760 --> 00:01:17.680
<i>The unknown horizon I watch with you</i>

00:01:12.760 --> 00:01:17.680
<i>kimi to mitsumeru michi naru chiheisen</i>

00:01:17.840 --> 00:01:22.560
<i>Now, be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:01:17.840 --> 00:01:22.560
<i>saa tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:01:22.720 --> 00:01:28.350
<i>Use the sun
That lights tomorrow as a guide</i>

00:01:22.720 --> 00:01:28.350
<i>asu wo terasu taiyou
mejirushi ni shitesa</i>

00:01:28.520 --> 00:01:34.190
<i>Fly off to the Glorious World of freedom</i>

00:01:28.520 --> 00:01:34.190
<i>tonde ike jiyuu na Glorious World</i>

00:01:37.400 --> 00:01:41.660
<i>The mysterious world where Digimon live,
the Digital World.</i>

00:01:42.990 --> 00:01:47.830
<i>Taichi Yagami and the Chosen Ones
with their partner Digimon</i>

00:01:47.830 --> 00:01:51.420
<i>continue their adventure to a new world.</i>

00:01:54.960 --> 00:01:59.640
<i>The children have become separated
on the mysterious new continent.</i>

00:02:05.810 --> 00:02:09.940
<i>The confusion online caused by
the rocket explosion in the real world</i>

00:02:10.560 --> 00:02:14.530
<i>granted power to vicious Digimon
that bared their fangs at Taichi.</i>

00:02:24.490 --> 00:02:30.750
<i>To make matters worse,
Hikari was taken away by Skullknightmon.</i>

00:02:37.010 --> 00:02:38.300
Hikari!

00:02:46.680 --> 00:02:49.480
Hikari!

00:02:50.690 --> 00:02:54.190
ESCAPE THE BURNING JUNGLE

00:02:57.820 --> 00:02:59.700
Hikari!

00:03:00.200 --> 00:03:01.450
Hikari!

00:03:11.330 --> 00:03:12.500
Taichi...

00:03:15.130 --> 00:03:16.980
Stand up, Taichi!

00:03:16.980 --> 00:03:21.220
Taichi, if you give up,
who's gonna save Hikari?!

00:03:30.850 --> 00:03:32.980
Thanks, Agumon.

00:03:33.770 --> 00:03:34.610
Sure.

00:03:38.070 --> 00:03:39.230
<i>Everyone...</i>

00:03:39.650 --> 00:03:43.840
<i>Hikari was taken away by Skullknightmon.</i>

00:03:43.840 --> 00:03:45.490
Hikari-chan?!

00:03:46.240 --> 00:03:47.830
Skullknightmon...

00:03:49.240 --> 00:03:51.580
...was alive after all.

00:03:52.790 --> 00:03:55.310
<i>Are you guys okay?</i>

00:03:55.310 --> 00:03:57.880
<i>Me and Agumon are fine.</i>

00:03:58.630 --> 00:03:59.550
<i>But...</i>

00:04:00.590 --> 00:04:01.760
I'm...

00:04:02.550 --> 00:04:04.510
gonna go after Hikari.

00:04:04.510 --> 00:04:07.610
We understand. Please be careful.

00:04:07.610 --> 00:04:10.020
<i>Sorry... Thanks.</i>

00:04:10.020 --> 00:04:13.950
I'll continue investigating
the rocket incident.

00:04:13.950 --> 00:04:17.020
Don't forget about meeting up!

00:04:17.020 --> 00:04:20.480
<i>Yes, I'll try to find you quickly.</i>

00:04:21.820 --> 00:04:24.090
<i>You too, Joe Senpai and Mimi-chan.</i>

00:04:24.090 --> 00:04:25.530
Roger!

00:04:25.530 --> 00:04:27.530
Yeah...

00:04:31.830 --> 00:04:32.660
<i>Taichi.</i>

00:04:33.910 --> 00:04:35.420
<i>I'm sure she's fine.</i>

00:04:35.960 --> 00:04:37.440
<i>I'm going to fight, too.</i>

00:04:37.440 --> 00:04:40.250
<i>So Taichi-san,
please fight for Hikari-chan.</i>

00:04:40.630 --> 00:04:42.760
I will, thanks.

00:04:46.140 --> 00:04:47.950
Let's go, Agumon!

00:04:47.950 --> 00:04:48.970
Okay!

00:05:03.820 --> 00:05:05.990
MEGADRAMON

00:05:40.360 --> 00:05:41.400
What's the matter?

00:05:43.230 --> 00:05:45.630
There's someone nearby.

00:05:45.630 --> 00:05:47.110
You can tell?

00:05:52.280 --> 00:05:53.370
What is it?!

00:05:59.040 --> 00:06:00.080
Taichi.

00:05:59.040 --> 00:06:01.290
WOODMON

00:06:02.670 --> 00:06:04.670
BUDMON

00:06:05.800 --> 00:06:07.880
LOPMON

00:06:13.430 --> 00:06:17.140
Are you here to destroy our jungle?

00:06:17.140 --> 00:06:20.330
Wait! We would never do that!

00:06:20.330 --> 00:06:23.150
I'm just looking for my little sister!

00:06:23.650 --> 00:06:25.480
Little sister?

00:06:25.900 --> 00:06:30.590
She's a human girl and she was kidnapped
by a Digimon with black armor.

00:06:30.590 --> 00:06:31.910
Have you seen her?

00:06:35.910 --> 00:06:37.160
I see.

00:06:40.540 --> 00:06:41.920
What's that sound?

00:06:42.420 --> 00:06:43.460
It's a hunt.

00:06:43.460 --> 00:06:44.690
Hunt?

00:06:44.690 --> 00:06:46.420
What's coming?

00:06:47.010 --> 00:06:50.510
We are those who wish to live in peace.

00:06:51.340 --> 00:06:55.910
However, this is a world
where the strong feed on the weak

00:06:55.910 --> 00:06:58.560
to compete for evolution.

00:07:09.450 --> 00:07:10.700
They will...

00:07:11.450 --> 00:07:15.240
chase prey to the ends of the world.

00:07:15.580 --> 00:07:17.870
And now, to this jungle.

00:07:32.680 --> 00:07:36.560
They've blocked our way!
We must find another escape route!

00:07:44.900 --> 00:07:47.070
ALLOMON

00:07:47.780 --> 00:07:49.110
Allomon!

00:07:53.070 --> 00:07:54.990
The fire hasn't reached this side yet!

00:07:55.620 --> 00:07:58.160
Everybody, run this way!

00:08:26.150 --> 00:08:28.900
You okay? Let's hurry over there!

00:08:35.410 --> 00:08:37.930
We, Woodmon, shall fight!

00:08:37.930 --> 00:08:40.910
At least until the others can escape!

00:09:09.650 --> 00:09:10.670
Taichi!

00:09:10.670 --> 00:09:12.820
Yeah. Let's go!

00:09:30.290 --> 00:09:34.090
Agumon Evolution!

00:09:47.440 --> 00:09:49.100
Greymon!

00:09:52.860 --> 00:09:55.240
Mega Flame!

00:09:58.990 --> 00:10:00.470
Now's our chance!

00:10:00.470 --> 00:10:01.830
This way!

00:10:11.420 --> 00:10:13.560
<i>Can everyone hear me?</i>

00:10:13.560 --> 00:10:15.050
<i>This is Koshiro.</i>

00:10:16.760 --> 00:10:19.610
<i>Everyone, attention please!</i>

00:10:19.610 --> 00:10:20.760
What's up?

00:10:21.300 --> 00:10:24.530
<i>It hasn't become a public issue yet,</i>

00:10:24.530 --> 00:10:27.620
<i>but I've found several small bugs</i>

00:10:27.620 --> 00:10:31.270
<i>within certain countries'
space-related control systems.</i>

00:10:32.820 --> 00:10:35.030
What does that mean?

00:10:35.480 --> 00:10:37.590
Currently around Earth,

00:10:37.590 --> 00:10:41.700
there are over 4,000
orbiting artificial satellites.

00:10:42.740 --> 00:10:44.430
Among a few of them,

00:10:44.430 --> 00:10:48.830
there's an orbital shift
caused by a control system error.

00:10:49.290 --> 00:10:51.830
<i>You're saying
the satellites are gonna fall?</i>

00:10:52.250 --> 00:10:57.730
No. This kind of problem
won't cause the satellites to fall.

00:10:57.730 --> 00:11:01.720
Even if it did, the friction would burn
them up in the atmosphere.

00:11:02.430 --> 00:11:04.930
<i>There'd be no effect on Earth's surface.</i>

00:11:05.390 --> 00:11:07.950
<i>Then there's no problem, right?</i>

00:11:07.950 --> 00:11:12.020
<i>Exactly. But that's what worries me.</i>

00:11:13.270 --> 00:11:17.740
<i>The confusion online caused by
the explosion is starting to calm as well.</i>

00:11:19.070 --> 00:11:23.280
<i>I just hope this isn't
the calm before the storm...</i>

00:11:24.660 --> 00:11:25.660
Got it.

00:11:26.080 --> 00:11:29.250
Continue to investigate, Koshiro.

00:11:30.330 --> 00:11:32.080
<i>Yes, Yamato-san!</i>

00:11:34.630 --> 00:11:37.920
We'll hurry to meet everyone.

00:11:39.420 --> 00:11:42.260
Mimi, we have lots of souvenirs!

00:11:42.970 --> 00:11:45.490
Let's solve this case quickly,

00:11:45.490 --> 00:11:50.410
so we can make a ton of accessories
with these gemstones!

00:11:50.410 --> 00:11:52.440
I can't wait!

00:11:52.980 --> 00:11:55.650
Joe, we should hurry too!

00:11:56.020 --> 00:12:02.030
I would love to do that,
but I'm a little dizzy from the heat...

00:12:03.360 --> 00:12:05.660
<i>Whoa, Joe!</i>

00:12:08.660 --> 00:12:09.660
Birdramon!

00:12:10.040 --> 00:12:10.910
Yeah!

00:12:18.590 --> 00:12:20.630
TANKDRAMON

00:12:46.530 --> 00:12:48.330
Mega Flame!

00:13:07.850 --> 00:13:09.640
So that's the boss!

00:13:25.450 --> 00:13:27.160
Get back, Greymon!

00:13:32.750 --> 00:13:34.250
Megadramon!

00:13:36.460 --> 00:13:37.420
Watch out!

00:13:50.470 --> 00:13:51.570
Greymon!

00:13:51.570 --> 00:13:52.720
Yeah!

00:14:20.580 --> 00:14:25.920
Greymon Super Evolution!

00:14:39.940 --> 00:14:42.690
Metalgreymon!

00:14:43.270 --> 00:14:45.570
Giga Storm!

00:14:52.530 --> 00:14:53.580
Let's fly!

00:15:36.410 --> 00:15:37.410
That way!

00:15:43.880 --> 00:15:45.880
Alright, here's good!

00:16:02.310 --> 00:16:05.360
They are fighting for us...

00:16:37.970 --> 00:16:39.600
Metalgreymon?!

00:16:59.410 --> 00:17:02.370
We can't lose at a place like this!

00:17:06.880 --> 00:17:09.500
I have to save Hikari...

00:17:29.270 --> 00:17:31.320
Taichi!

00:17:34.820 --> 00:17:36.700
Get down!

00:17:38.490 --> 00:17:40.660
Everyone, hide!

00:17:42.910 --> 00:17:45.500
Shadow Wing!

00:18:05.350 --> 00:18:06.620
<i>Taichi.</i>

00:18:06.620 --> 00:18:07.810
Sora!

00:18:08.310 --> 00:18:10.360
<i>I'm glad I found you guys.</i>

00:18:10.360 --> 00:18:11.570
Yeah.

00:18:12.820 --> 00:18:15.690
The fire's gone! Run while you can!

00:18:33.550 --> 00:18:35.380
What a tough one...

00:18:42.850 --> 00:18:45.100
Sora, hold on tight!

00:19:00.490 --> 00:19:02.260
Taichi!

00:19:02.260 --> 00:19:03.910
Go!

00:19:35.860 --> 00:19:36.650
Huh?

00:19:47.750 --> 00:19:50.250
We will fight with you!

00:20:01.010 --> 00:20:05.010
Metalgreymon, blast your missiles
into that main cannon!

00:20:06.510 --> 00:20:09.680
Giga Destroyer!

00:20:39.760 --> 00:20:40.880
Yes!

00:21:00.070 --> 00:21:01.190
We did it!

00:21:12.410 --> 00:21:13.580
Taichi.

00:21:13.870 --> 00:21:14.870
Yeah.

00:21:15.960 --> 00:21:17.750
It's not over yet.

00:22:31.240 --> 00:22:32.870
<i>The Digimon Encyclopedia!</i>

00:22:34.370 --> 00:22:35.970
<i>Skullknightmon.</i>

00:22:35.970 --> 00:22:39.100
<i>A mysterious Digimon wrapped
in black armor.</i>

00:22:36.080 --> 00:22:39.100
LEVEL: CHAMPION

00:22:39.100 --> 00:22:41.100
TYPE: UNDEAD

00:22:39.100 --> 00:22:43.050
<i>Skullknightmon wields spears in both hands
to corner the enemy.</i>

00:22:41.100 --> 00:22:43.050
SPECIAL MOVE:
SPEAR NEEDLE / BREAST-EYE WINK

00:22:43.500 --> 00:22:45.300
<i>Now, let's check this out!</i>

00:22:45.300 --> 00:22:48.070
<i>Since there wasn't much data,
I asked around.</i>

00:22:48.070 --> 00:22:49.320
<i>Tentomon said,</i>

00:22:49.320 --> 00:22:53.530
<i>"Skullknightmon's probably very
competitive and surprisingly sensitive."</i>

00:22:53.530 --> 00:22:55.100
<i>I wonder if that's true...</i>

00:22:57.730 --> 00:23:00.020
<i>Which Digimon will it be next time?</i>

00:23:01.560 --> 00:23:05.460
<i>The hearts of Taichi and Agumon
who bravely face a swarm of enemies</i>

00:23:05.460 --> 00:23:07.860
<i>awaken a great power.</i>

00:23:07.860 --> 00:23:11.870
<i>Next time on Digimon Adventure:
"The Mega Digimon, Wargreymon"</i>

00:23:11.870 --> 00:23:14.700
<i>The adventure continues to a new world.</i>
